$* bracketPML / export-safe - probe: the safe start, the count and the end line, on ONE element.
$* Stand on any element. Paste as Macro. Read-only: the model is not changed.
$* Then: python read_export.py C:\Temp\bpml-probe.txt  ->  ok: 1 items
$* Run it twice: the first line closes a log left open by anything before, the error is caught.
alpha log END
handle any
endhandle
!n = 0
alpha log /C:\Temp\bpml-probe.txt OVERWRITE
$P #BPML BEGIN
VAR !rf REF
VAR !nm NAME
$P #ITEM $!rf $!nm
!n = !n + 1
$P #BPML END $!n
alpha log END
$P written: C:\Temp\bpml-probe.txt
